              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi dzambo hiro rakala ni ahadi ya Mwenyezi Mlungu ariyomupha mfalume Jehu. Iye wamuamba, “Chivyazicho chindatawala Iziraeli hadi chivyazi cha ne.” Na ichikala hivyo.",
          "type": "text",
