          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shalumu mwana wa Jabeshi waandza kutawala Iziraeli mwaka wa mirongo mihahu na tisiya wa utawala wa mfalume Uziya wa Juda na watawala kula Samariya kpwa muda wa mwezi mmwenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu mwana wa Gadi wala Tirisa kuphiya Samariya, na hiko wampiga Shalumu mwana wa Jabeshi achimuolaga, chisha achitawala badalaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahendo ganjina gosi ga Shalumu na njamaye ya uasi, gaandikpwa kpwenye Chitabu cha Mambo ga Nyakati za Afalume a Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu wabomola kabisa mudzi wa Tifusa kuandzira Tirisa na kuaangamiza enyezie phamwenga na tsi yosi iriyouzunguluka kpwa sababu taayamvugurira ryango. Wahala vitu na achiahula ndani za achetu a mimba ariokala himo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
