              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu mwana wa Gadi waandza kutawala Iziraeli mwaka wa mirongo mihahu na tisiya wa utawala wa mfalume Uziya wa Juda. Menahemu watawala kula Samariya kpwa muda wa miaka kumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahenda mai mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu. Kayaricha mai ga Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, ambaye waahenda atu a Iziraeli amenye dambini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi, Puli mfalume wa Ashuru washambuliya tsi ya Iziraeli, naye Menahemu achimupha kilo elufu mirongo mihahu na ne za feza ili amterye kuimarisha mamlakage dzulu ya tsi ya Iziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Menahemu waphaha feza iyo kpwa kualazimisha matajiri a Iziraeli kulavya mtsango wa vipande mirongo mitsano vya feza chila mmwenga. Phahi mfalume wa Ashuru kayakala Iziraeli, wauya kpwakpwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
