            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peka mwana wa Remaliya, yekala mkpwulu wa jeshi ra Pekahia, waungana na atu mirongo mitsano kula Giliadi achimpangira njama na achimuolaga Pekahia phamwenga na Arigobu na Ariye ndani ya ngome ya nyumba ya mfalume ko Samariya. Naye Peka achikala mfalume badalaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
